; Module-definition file for RobloxStudioPatcher.dll
;
; Exports a single dummy function "Patch" so that stud_pe (and any other PE
; editor) has something concrete to point an import at. The real work all
; happens in DllMain on DLL_PROCESS_ATTACH; the host EXE doesn't need to
; actually call Patch() for the mod to take effect.
;
; If you want a second symbol for some reason, add another EXPORTS line.

LIBRARY RobloxStudioPatcher
EXPORTS
    Patch @1
